iginHeight%22%3A340%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.4500000476837158%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23aedfcd%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1396b216%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf591dce6\" id=\"uf591dce6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9edbc15\" id=\"ua9edbc15\">如何</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2df68a7b\" id=\"u2df68a7b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">避免</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u02fff2bd\" id=\"u02fff2bd\">野指针：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0464f632\" id=\"u0464f632\"><span data-lake-id=\"u657779db\" id=\"u657779db\">1》定义指针变量时，初始化为NULL；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubdf6a426\" id=\"ubdf6a426\"><span data-lake-id=\"u269d6b37\" id=\"u269d6b37\">2》动态内存中，free()后，将指针变量赋值为NULL；</span></p><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tCHBK%22%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"wcHFG\" id=\"wcHFG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0724cd19\" id=\"u0724cd19\">3&gt; 空指针 （NULL）</span></h1><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%23define%20NULL%20((void%20*)0)%5Cn%5Cnint%20main()%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E7%A9%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%9A%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E4%B8%BA0x00%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%EF%BC%9B%5Cn%5Ctint%20*ptr%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22ptr%20%3D%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20ptr)%3B%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct*ptr%20%3D%2051888%3B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%A9%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%EF%BC%8C%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%BF%85%E7%84%B6%E5%B4%A9%E6%BA%83%3B%5Cn%5Ctprintf(%5C%22*ptr%20%3D%20%25p%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20*ptr)%3B%5Ct%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EPPra%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2184d150\" id=\"u2184d150\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c181e50\" id=\"u5c181e50\">定义指针变量时，不初始化，就会出现野指针，操作过程中，可能导致程序崩溃，或访问到其他地方，出现奇怪的bug；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc1d1872a\" id=\"uc1d1872a\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4cb2e9fa\" id=\"u4cb2e9fa\">定义指针变量时，初始化为空指针，如果不进行赋值，直接访问肯定会出错，方便程序员找到错误，所以定义指针变量时通常初始化为空指针；</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2ad01743\" id=\"u2ad01743\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u458b2268\" id=\"u458b2268\">​</span><br></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%E7%A9%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23include%20%3Cstdio.h%3E%5Cn%5Cnint%20main(void)%5Cn%7B%5Cn%5Ctint%20*p%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctif%20(p%20!%3D%20NULL)%20%7B%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%BA%E7%A9%BA%E5%86%8D%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%5Cn%5Ct%5Ct*p%20%3D%20888%3B%5Cn%5Ct%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20p%20%3D%20NULL%3B%5Ct%5Ct%2F%2F%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E5%AE%8C%EF%BC%8C%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%BANULL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5Cn%5Ct%5Cn%5Ctreturn%200%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E7%A9%BA%E6%8C%87%E9%92%88%E5%B8%B8%E8%A7%81%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BRvuE%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7